  "page": "page-04",
  "idea": "Stirling-PDF: 100 percent free open-source PDF power tool",
  "text": "You can split, merge, sign, and convert PDFs completely offline for free. Operations managers frequently get blocked waiting on external signature tools just to process signed contractor agreements. Relying on cloud services exposes sensitive tax forms and stalls execution when internet connections drop unexpectedly. Stirling-PDF runs locally as a lightweight container that handles full page reordering and digital signing instantly. Your document pipeline stays completely private and lightning fast.",
